WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:03.845
Once it is playing, the file also says what happens next.

2
00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:11.270
When the pointer leaves, it can pause, go back to the start, or carry on.

3
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.650
Scrolled out of view, it can pause, carry on, or start over when it comes back.

4
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.982
All of it is in the file. Set it once in the editor.
